==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features {{p|Cherrim}} in its {{form|Cherrim|Overcast Form}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Arceus|Cherrim|15}} from the {{TCG|Platinum: Arceus}} expansion; both cards have the Worry Seed attack.
*{{m|Worry Seed}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Cherrim}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

